sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant CLI as Vigilo Setup
    participant DB as Control Database
    participant GitHub as Official GitHub Releases
    participant Host as Evaluator Host
    Operator->>CLI: setup [--evaluators ID | --skip-evaluators]
    CLI->>DB: Apply pending migrations and validate placement
    opt Evaluators enabled
        CLI->>GitHub: Discover published collection and read bounded catalog
        CLI->>CLI: Validate catalog and select exact compatible ABI set
        loop Each evaluator (sequential)
            CLI->>DB: Read existing version
            alt Matching identity already installed
                DB-->>CLI: Skip download and preserve lifecycle state
            else Version absent
                CLI->>GitHub: Stream archive into owned temporary file
                CLI->>CLI: Verify size and SHA-256
                CLI->>Host: Validate portable package, compile, typed-link ABI
                Host-->>CLI: Prepared artifact
                CLI->>CLI: Match prepared artifact to catalog
                CLI->>DB: Insert missing version; retain all existing versions
            end
        end
    end
    CLI-->>Operator: Success or contextual error; completed work retained
